				<wikidot:authorName>fieldstone</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1436137</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>usually they kill baby hitler, which doesnt work, cuz the nazis would just get a different man to run their organization</p> </blockquote> <p>This made me google the history of the nazi party. Hitler took over its leadership pretty early in its formation and was instrumental in its rise to power (which coincided with his release from prison for attempting a premature coup). The nazi party was anti-Semitic from its founding - Hitler didn't invent that - but, at least according to my 10 minutes of internet research, they would have been much less likely to end up winning control in that form (and then perpetrating the Holocaust) without him.</p> <p>Also this tale is good and reminds me that lolfoundation can be good.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
