					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Everyone says they would go back in time to kill Hitler.</p> <p>But I've never ever seen anyone say that they would go back further to Hitler's days as a painter and tell him that in the future, after his death, his works would be seen as classics up there with Van Gogh.</p> <p>What I'm saying is we need a temporal Bob Ross to save America.</p> 
